    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Severed Decks is not your run-of-the-mill blackjack game.<br> <br>It's a lethal, high-stakes battle where every hand could be your last. In this dark, twisted card game of thee versus thee, two players compete in a gruesome version of blackjack wherein one key difference exists: the loser faces an extremely brutal demise under a menacing, spinning circular saw. Feel the tension rise with each flipped card, knowing one bad choice may cost you your head\u2014literally.</p>",
